@startuml
title Regulatory Compliance Control Record - BIAN UML
' Generated from BIAN Control Record diagram for machine-readable context
' Service Domain: Regulatory Compliance
' Source: https://bian.org/servicelandscape-14-0-0/views/view_48353.html
' Extraction: SVG semantic extraction (svg_to_puml_v2)
' Annotation legend:
'   <<datatype>>            -> the SVG marks this shape as UML_DataType (not a plain class)
'   BianBom: yes            -> this class/enum/datatype sits inside the SVG's
'                              dashed "BIAN BOM" grouping box
'   Extensible: yes/no      -> from the class box border color in the SVG:
'                              red border only (fill #eae8e8 / stroke #c47474) = yes,
'                              this class's attributes MAY be pulled into this
'                              diagram from its owning Service Domain if needed;
'                              fully red (fill #ff8080 / stroke #d91616) = no,
'                              extending it is not allowed. Absent = plain
'                              class (fill #ffffff / stroke #d9d9d9), not part
'                              of this distinction.
'   BQ: <name>              -> Behavior Qualifier note linked to this class
'   AssetType: <name>       -> AssetType note linked to this class
'   ControlRecord: <name>   -> ControlRecord note linked to this class
'   GenericArtifact: <name> -> GenericArtifact note linked to this class
'   HelperDiagram: <name>   -> local BOM helper-diagram box named "<Class> Helper Diagram"
'   BOMDiagram: <name>      -> cross-service-domain BOM diagram box named "<Class> BOM Diagram"
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction

class "CR Regulatory Compliance Assessment Instance Record" as N313875 {
  + Regulatory Assessment Type : Text
  + Business Unit Reference : Business Unit
  + Product and Service Reference : Product
  + Customer Reference : InvolvedParty
  + Regulatory Authority Reference : Regulatory Authority
  + Regulation Reference : Regulation
  + Regulation Definition : Text
  + Regulation Compliance and Reporting Requirements : Text
  + Regulation Accountability : Business Unit
  + Regulation Penalties : Text
  + Regulation Guideline : Guideline
  + Document Reference : Document
  + Regulatory Assessment Work Products : WorkProduct
  + Regulatory Assessment Result
  + Regulatory Compliance Assessment Reference : Identifier
  + Assessment Requestor : InvolvedParty
  + Assessment Start Date : DateTime
  + Assessment Completion Date : DateTime
  + Regulation Customer Type : OrganisationLegalStructureTypeValues
  + Regulation Customer Residence Status : ResidentalStatusTypeValues
  + Regulation Valid from Date : DateTime
  + Regulation Valid to Date : DateTime
}

